{
 "batchId": "b-0284",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_718ee3528c6b7988a2f8",
   "sourceHash": "718ee3528c6b7988a2f8ba973b4c223fa1e1177b847761417f22b359e98b3d9c",
   "text": "Meenvallam 瀑布发源于 Thuppanadu 河口，是喀拉拉邦一处隐秘的瑰宝。这座十级瀑布兼具迷人之美与壮阔全景，水流从约 20 至 25 英尺的高处落下。瀑布上部八级隐藏在茂密的森林之中，下部两级则对游客开放。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2096cd9f01cf10d3a6eb",
   "sourceHash": "2096cd9f01cf10d3a6eb68996bbbe1def145b0a5ee569017aeaa4cea48c70438",
   "text": "晴朗蓝天下，一道长长的混凝土坝墙沿宽阔的水库延伸",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0b11bbdfb3681b6d2205",
   "sourceHash": "0b11bbdfb3681b6d22057e11756c4730c26e2127a988338a9a9edecf17e00b95",
   "text": "Meenkara 因横跨 Meenkara 河而建的水坝成为旅游胜地。Meenkara 河是 Gayathripuzha 河的一条支流，最终汇入 Bharathapuzha 河。这座水坝气势恢宏、景色纯美，令观者大饱眼福。这里设有养鱼场和秀美的花园，是野餐的绝佳去处。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f0f0df6f575bbfa8e326",
   "sourceHash": "f0f0df6f575bbfa8e32686a7b0338fd49ae89a1de65e0628e2b10d09103c77c0",
   "text": "水坝向下方水库泄水，背后是林木葱郁的山丘",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_30ca32f37ac8754fbbef",
   "sourceHash": "30ca32f37ac8754fbbef44f916b0027b2184d993722fb8367579569212ebf7f7",
   "text": "Kanjirapuzha 水坝四周群山环抱，常绿密林与棉絮般的云朵交相辉映，是一座引人入胜的天然水坝。水库中共有三座小岛，鱼类丰富，景象蔚为壮观。如果您希望在大自然的神秘意境中寻得宁静，来到喀拉拉邦时一定要到此一游。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dd84678ba68c2837d01a",
   "sourceHash": "dd84678ba68c2837d01ae4313fa0cf53bb4c88cf74122bc394f0ecf005de4dee",
   "text": "沿水库大坝堤岸延伸的道路，通向云雾缭绕的青翠山丘",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2830c47950190adef44f",
   "sourceHash": "2830c47950190adef44f08805abeedfd62bb0e0e485ae6a56e3223188b892cae",
   "text": "Pothundy 水坝横跨 Meenichiladipuzha 河和 Padipuzha 河而建，被认为是印度最古老的水坝之一。其核心坝墙由粗糖（jaggery）与生石灰混合筑成，因而独具特色。Pothundy 水坝是野餐或一日游的理想去处。您还可以顺道游览附近的 Padagiri、Kilakettara、Nemmara 和 Kollengode 等景点。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_40cbe446140af5253ce8",
   "sourceHash": "40cbe446140af5253ce8e86b6d54324b9879816d04dbae7244b35ae257f22c3c",
   "text": "巴拉卡德周边最佳旅游景点 | 喀拉拉邦风景胜地",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "\"Getaways\" rendered as 风景胜地 (scenic spots) to avoid holiday/vacation framing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8817e35907f168441699",
   "sourceHash": "8817e35907f1684416991d8bc2661d5a4b6d9c0d0cf68bc683170613fbed068b",
   "text": "探索巴拉卡德周边 50 公里以外的热门景点，从山间避暑地到野生动物保护区，适合探险、徒步与文化体验。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6ffac7f96bf0e884b3df",
   "sourceHash": "6ffac7f96bf0e884b3df015a8e7efd2f24fef2e92f8e048faa03e630aad6bef2",
   "text": "距 Ayurvedic Healing Village：75 公里",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_38f322134b26762046de",
   "sourceHash": "38f322134b26762046de7f8b75b620fbd399c3899de69dd3a3f32adc316705e3",
   "text": "距 Ayurvedic Healing Village：70 公里",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9917787da4ef25e9f127",
   "sourceHash": "9917787da4ef25e9f1270f6ce4d8ec10b651014b3ee76167bed15288bffe5fa8",
   "text": "距 Ayurvedic Healing Village：80 公里",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6db49d7253cdd4f82fb8",
   "sourceHash": "6db49d7253cdd4f82fb83c76b02280b298b5f55ffdb03ce5acc38d012f9341ba",
   "text": "距 Ayurvedic Healing Village：100 公里",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_61619779d21f7320e461",
   "sourceHash": "61619779d21f7320e461767103411c5fa0a5157e0dd1efd518ed65fbd678afef",
   "text": "巴拉卡德拥有多样的自然风光和人造奇观，在喀拉拉邦旅游版图中占有一席之地。这里已成为探险、徒步和亲近自然最受欢迎的目的地之一，吸引着来自世界各地的人们。除了巴拉卡德境内及周边的景点之外，如果您愿意再往荒野深处走一走，还有更多精彩的旅游胜地值得一游。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_70a0df168b2b97c224da",
   "sourceHash": "70a0df168b2b97c224da37a66264fa4af7027c56ebe482f3611770bf50b48f97",
   "text": "从青翠山坡上望去，水库被林木覆盖的山丘和一座岩石山峰环绕",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2503deaef491d2e24e7a",
   "sourceHash": "2503deaef491d2e24e7a9af35bedf16c93e92ca42682da31479147454c442cc9",
   "text": "Nelliyampathy 被誉为“巴拉卡德群山女王”，这里轻云缭绕，别具魅力。橘园与常绿森林交织成的美景令人流连忘返，非常适合放松身心的停留。这一带以茶园、咖啡园、豆蔻种植园、瀑布和宜人的气候而闻名。这座山间避暑地虽小却十分秀美，是徒步、吉普车游览以及观鸟和观赏动物的理想之地。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "\"relaxing vacation\" rendered as 放松身心的停留 (relaxing stay) per banned-word rule."
   ]
  }
 ]
}
